                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "So i posted something saying how this is a real steal to ask people money for this game. The creator added me and then gave me a free key so i can play the game first insted of saying crap whitout first playing (Because he said there is much more crappy game that cost something then his game on steam so it aint stealing). So i did play the game.\n\nHoly sh!t this game is bad. This is made in unity and is prbl made with a bunch of free tools. Litteraly something a kid would do at school for a project. The menu doesn't even have an clickable option (the only option is when you first lauch the game) You can't even set the sensitivity of the mouse ingame, and when you close the game, THERE IS NO SAVE. There is a big load game button but its not clickable.\n\nThe gameplay is really really really boring. What you see in the store trailer is litteraly all there is to the gameplay. Each level is the same exact thing you do exept its a different shape. Kill all the bad guy and thats it. You can run and you can jump. Jump is useless. Sometime you will be a bit lower then the enemy so maybe you will want to jump so your bullet hits, but thats it. There is better FREE game on miniclip for god sake. I bet this game couldn't even get posted on miniclip (if they do any kind of filtering) since this game is so bad. I know this is early access but holy shit. WHY EVEN PUT THIS GAME ON STEAM IF ITS SOOOOO MUCH IN EARLY ACCESS THAT THERE IS ABSOLUTLY NOTHING FUN ABOUT THIS GAME. AND THEN YOU GO AND ASK PEOPLE MONEY FOR IT? This guy is basicly a scammer. I wish somone with stolen credit card would buy this game a 1000 time and then cancel the payment. He would have 1000 individual fees to pay from his pocket cause of the administration fees or something when somone cancel his purchase cause he got his card stolen AND lose the entire  money from the sale of the game. Just a scammer getting scammed basicly ;)",
